# Cloudflare Pages redirects for the standalone Expo web export (app.boardsesh.com).
#
# SPA fallback: Expo Router is a single-page app, so any path that is not a real
# file (deep links like /climbs or /auth/callback?transferToken=…) must serve the
# exported shell with a 200, not a 404. The `200` status makes this a rewrite
# (URL stays put), not a redirect. Real files (_expo/*, assets/*, wasm/*,
# index.html) are matched by Pages before this catch-all, so they serve directly.
/*    /index.html    200
